// Title: Suspicious Dropbox API Usage
// Rule ID: 25eabf56-22f0-4915-a1ed-056b8dae0a68
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.exfiltration, attack.t1105, attack.t1567.002
// Category: network_connection
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_domain_dropbox_api.yml
